e scaffold initially sized probes from the production frame constant and stayed green under a widened bound — now retyped like all fixtures.\n\nGates, all with real exit codes: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (18 pkgs), `-race` on dirnode exit 0, `go vet` both platforms exit 0, `go build` exit 0, gofmt clean, tracecheck ok, coverage 74.9% → 83.3%.","reason":null}}
